321
00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.740
Her mood shifted abruptly.

322
00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:48.040
With a mischievous smile, she became extraordinarily lively,

323
00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.280
talkative, and playful.

324
00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.360
She slipped her arm through mine, laughing with

325
00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:55.660
a lightness that seemed almost calculated.

326
00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.540
Every faltering, confused word I tried to speak

327
00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.540
