328
00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.160
and ringing.

329
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.340
Her amusement, so sudden and unrelenting, began to

330
00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.060
irritate me.

331
00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.720
It felt as though she was flirting deliberately,

332
00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.680
