339
00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.340
But then again, Mr. Unapproachable, she added teasingly,

340
00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.540
you can't blame me for being so simple.

341
00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:35.100
I tell you everything, every silly, foolish thought

342
00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.260
