350
00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.720
The slow, deliberate chimes echoed faintly through the

351
00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:56.320
quiet night.

352
00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:59.780
She stopped suddenly, her laughter fading as her

353
00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:00.740
expression changed.

354
00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:04.280
She stood still, her face tense, and began

355
00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.420
