397
00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:37.320
Anything could have delayed him.

398
00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.200
As I spoke, I could see her tension

399
00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.160
easing, her breathing slowing.

400
00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.720
She wanted so much to believe me, and

401
00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.480
I wanted even more to make her believe,

402
00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.740
to ease her worry even for a little

403
00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:49.140
while.

404
00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.540
At that moment she was so vulnerable, so

405
00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.680
ready to grasp at any straw of hope.

406
00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:58.480
I continued, feeling a strange sense of responsibility,

407
00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.440
almost a duty to shield her from despair.

408
00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:05.040
I'll tell you what, I said finally, feeling

409
00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.160
more confident now.

410
00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.400
As soon as it's light tomorrow, I'll go

411
00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.960
to check for his reply myself.

412
00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.380
If there's an answer, I'll bring it to

413
00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.080
