416
00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:18.660
the worst.

417
00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.900
There are thousands of possibilities.

418
00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.780
Anything could have happened.

419
00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.780
She nodded slowly, her face softening as the

420
00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:29.200
faintest flicker of hope returned to her eyes.

421
00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.300
For a moment it seemed as though she

422
00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.560
had found a little peace.

423
00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.920
Yes, yes, said Nastenka eagerly, as though suddenly

424
00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.480
