425
00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.140
I didn't think of that.

426
00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:44.020
Of course anything could happen, she added, though

427
00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.880
her voice trailed off into a tone of

428
00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:46.780
