429
00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:50.120
There was no real conviction behind her words,

430
00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:53.600
only a faint, distant echo of another thought,

431
00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.740
some vexing discord lingering in her mind, unresolved.

432
00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:01.600
I know what you must do, she said

433
00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.200
after a pause, her tone growing more certain.

434
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.140
