490
00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.200
She hesitated, then looked directly at me, her

491
00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.500
eyes filled with strange mixture of sadness and

492
00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:20.960
warmth.

493
00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:23.060
