505
00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.260
But I stayed silent, struggling to contain the

506
00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.040
storm of emotions her confession had unleashed within

507
00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:56.320
me.

508
00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.440
Perhaps, she said after another long pause, as

509
00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:03.220
though trying to fill the silence herself, perhaps

510
00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.400
it's just that I don't understand him fully

511
00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:05.800
yet.

512
00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.520
You know, I've always been a little afraid

513
00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:08.860
