516
00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.960
But I know it's only a facade, deep

517
00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.940
down I know there's more tenderness in his

518
00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.180
heart than even in mine.

519
00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.660
I remember how he looked at me that

520
00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.580
day, when I went to him with my

521
00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:25.220
little bundle.

522
